sequenceDiagram
    participant nmf_monetization as nmf_monetization
    actor Siren as Siren
    actor Seller as Seller
    participant frontendplatform as frontendplatform
    participant graphql as graphql
    participant External as External
    Note over nmf_monetization,graphql: nMF mails the seller about an add-on event
    External->>nmf_monetization: nmfbus.AddOnPurchased (from graphql)
    nmf_monetization->>nmf_monetization: picks the mail resolver from the event type alone
    nmf_monetization->>Siren: to send the purchase mail [POST /api/v1/event]
    Note over nmf_monetization,graphql: Seller buys an add-on
    Seller->>frontendplatform: buys an add-on
    frontendplatform->>graphql: to buy the add-on [buyAddOn]
    graphql-)graphql: notifies "nmfbus.AddOnPurchased"
    Note over nmf_monetization,graphql: Site session preamble
    Seller->>frontendplatform: opens the site
    frontendplatform->>graphql: for the session [session]
    Note over nmf_monetization,graphql: Seller asks the assistant a question
    Seller->>frontendplatform: asks the assistant a question
    Note over Seller,frontendplatform: ref: Site session preamble
    frontendplatform->>graphql: to stream the answer [assistantStream]
    Note over nmf_monetization,graphql: Seller promotes an advert
    Seller->>frontendplatform: promotes an advert
    frontendplatform->>graphql: for the promotion offers [promotionOffers]
    Note over frontendplatform,graphql: continues: Seller pays at the checkout
    Note over nmf_monetization,graphql: Seller pays at the checkout
    Seller->>frontendplatform: pays at the checkout
    frontendplatform->>graphql: to pay [payInvoice]
